	(text "One header to check every logic rail with a DMM during bring-up steps 2\nand 3 of TEST_PLAN 5. The rails themselves, and their isolation links and\ncurrent breaks, belong to power_rails - this header only observes them.\n\n  1 +5V    2 +3V3    3 +3V3A    4 GND    5 GND    6 GND\n\n+24V IS DELIBERATELY NOT ON THIS HEADER. 24 V next to 3.3 V on a 2.54 mm\nstrip is one slip away from destroying the board; power_entry_24v already\ncarries the +24V_SW test point and current break that TEST_PLAN 4 asks for.\n\n+3V3A is the MCU VDDA / VREF+ analogue rail the mcu stub note lists as an\ninput. If power_rails names that rail differently, this header and the mcu\nsheet both follow it - see docs/decisions/actuator-sch-mcu.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 212.72 84.46 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "cbd689f3-74aa-5a8c-9d7e-db108b2fb191")
	)
